- The Argon2id variant is explicitly specified, preventing accidental use of Argon2d or Argon2i.
- The chosen memory cost is exactly 12MB minimum, as mandated.
- The code does not store plain-text passwords anywhere.
- Passwords are verified securely and errors are generic to avoid user enumeration.
- JWT secret management is assumed to be environment-based and secure.
- Database queries use parameterized queries to prevent SQL injection.

